### ============================================
### CONTACT MANAGEMENT TESTS
### ============================================
### Test all contact endpoints (customer & admin)

### ================================================
### CUSTOMER - CONTACT FORM SUBMISSION
### ================================================

### 1. Submit Contact Form (Without Auth - Anonymous)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Budi Santoso",
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "whatsapp_number": "081234567890",
  "subject": "Pertanyaan tentang produk sayuran organik",
  "message": "Halo BaleTani, saya ingin menanyakan apakah tersedia paket sayuran organik mingguan? Berapa harganya dan bagaimana sistem pengirimannya? Terima kasih."
}

### 2. Submit Contact Form (With Auth - Logged In Customer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/contact
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Ahmad Customer",
  "email": "ahmad@example.com",
  "whatsapp_number": "085885725027",
  "subject": "Pertanyaan tentang pengiriman",
  "message": "Halo, saya sudah order kemarin tapi belum ada kabar. Bisa tolong dicek? Order ID: ORD-123456. Terima kasih banyak!"
}

### 3. Validation Test - Missing Required Fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Test User",
  "subject": "Test"
}

### 4. Validation Test - Invalid WhatsApp Format
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Test User",
  "whatsapp_number": "123",
  "subject": "Test Subject",
  "message": "This is a test message with more than 20 characters"
}

### 5. Validation Test - Invalid Email Format
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Test User",
  "whatsapp_number": "081234567890",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "subject": "Test Subject",
  "message": "This is a test message with more than 20 characters"
}

### 6. Spam Prevention Test - 6th Message in Same Day (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Spam User",
  "whatsapp_number": "081234567890",
  "subject": "Test Message 6",
  "message": "This is the 6th message from the same number today, should be blocked"
}

### 7. Get My Messages (Customer - Auth Required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/customer/contact/my-messages
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### 8. Get My Message Detail (Customer - Auth Required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/customer/contact/my-messages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### ================================================
### ADMIN - CONTACT MANAGEMENT
### ================================================

### 9. Get All Contact Messages (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. Get All Messages with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts?page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11. Get All Messages - Filter by Status (Pending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 12. Get All Messages - Filter by Status (Replied)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts?status=replied
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 13. Get All Messages - Search by Name
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts?search=Budi
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 14. Get All Messages - Search by Subject
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts?search=pengiriman
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 15. Get All Messages - Date Range Filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts?from_date=2025-11-01&to_date=2025-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 16. Get Single Message Detail (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 17. Update Message Status to 'read'
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "read"
}

### 18. Update Message Status to 'replied' with Notes
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "replied",
  "admin_notes": "Sudah dibalas via WhatsApp pada tanggal 15 Nov 2025 pukul 14:30"
}

### 19. Update Message Status to 'resolved'
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "resolved"
}

### 20. Update Admin Notes Only
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts/1/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "admin_notes": "Customer sudah puas dengan penjelasan yang diberikan. Case closed."
}

### 21. Get Contact Statistics (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 22. Delete Contact Message (Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 23. Validation Test - Invalid Status
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "invalid_status"
}

### 24. Test Unauthorized Access (No Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts

### 25. Test with Invalid Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/contacts
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here

### ================================================
### BATCH TESTS - Create Multiple Messages
### ================================================

### 26. Create Message - Pembayaran Issue
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Siti Nurhaliza",
  "email": "siti@example.com",
  "whatsapp_number": "082123456789",
  "subject": "Konfirmasi Pembayaran",
  "message": "Saya sudah transfer pembayaran sejak 2 hari yang lalu tapi status order masih pending. Mohon dicek. Transfer ke BCA a.n. BaleTani sebesar Rp 150.000"
}

### 27. Create Message - Product Quality
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Dewi Lestari",
  "email": "dewi@example.com",
  "whatsapp_number": "083234567890",
  "subject": "Komplain Kualitas Produk",
  "message": "Sayuran yang saya terima kemarin kondisinya sudah layu. Padahal baru sampai pagi ini. Apa bisa dikembalikan atau diganti? Order ID: ORD-789012"
}

### 28. Create Message - Partnership Inquiry
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Rizki Hidayat",
  "email": "rizki.hidayat@perusahaan.com",
  "whatsapp_number": "081987654321",
  "subject": "Kerja Sama B2B",
  "message": "Kami dari PT. Segar Sehat tertarik untuk melakukan kerja sama pembelian sayuran dalam jumlah besar untuk kebutuhan kantin perusahaan. Apakah ada harga khusus untuk pembelian grosir? Mohon info lebih lanjut."
}

### 29. Create Message - Delivery Issue
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Andi Pratama",
  "whatsapp_number": "085567890123",
  "subject": "Pesanan Belum Sampai",
  "message": "Order saya dari tanggal 13 November belum sampai juga. Tracking number tidak bisa dicek. Order ID: ORD-456789. Tolong segera ditindaklanjuti, ini sudah hari ketiga."
}

### 30. Create Message - General Question
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Maya Putri",
  "email": "maya@example.com",
  "whatsapp_number": "087890123456",
  "subject": "Pertanyaan Jam Operasional",
  "message": "Halo, saya mau tanya jam operasional toko offline BaleTani hari Minggu buka atau tidak? Dan alamat lengkapnya dimana ya? Terima kasih."
}
